  "details": "Concept :\n\nIntroduce a feature allowing group creators on VRChat to upgrade their public groups using VRChat Credits. This upgrade gives them exclusive visibility and style benefits, while keeping access free for users.\n\n How It Works\n\n- Only the group creator pays for the upgrade using VRChat Credits. Once activated:\n\n- Golden Crown Badge: A crown icon appears on the group’s logo, signaling premium status.\n\n- Member Badges: All group members automatically receive a visual badge identifying their affiliation with a premium group.\n\n- Top Visibility: All public instances created by the group are boosted to the top of the public world/group list in the VRChat UI.\n\n- Users don’t pay to join the group – it remains public and open, preserving accessibility while giving creators an incentive to support their communities.\n\nGoals :\n\n-Empower community leaders to promote and grow their groups.\n\n-Create a healthy, optional monetization system for group creators.\n\n-Reward groups that contribute positively to VRChat’s ecosystem.",
